WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:22.880
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:22.881 --> 00:00:26.561
I'm a parrot.

3
00:00:26.562 --> 00:00:31.018
Parrots are a type of bird.

4
00:00:31.019 --> 00:00:33.805
Where do you live?

5
00:00:33.806 --> 00:00:38.604
Parrots live all over the world.

6
00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:44.940
Most parrots like warm places like rain forests.

7
00:00:44.941 --> 00:00:49.517
But some live in snowy places.

8
00:00:49.518 --> 00:00:52.951
What do you eat?

9
00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:57.646
Parrots mostly eat nuts and seeds.

10
00:00:57.647 --> 00:01:03.945
Our beaks are sharp.

11
00:01:03.946 --> 00:01:09.612
We use them to crack open nuts and seeds.

12
00:01:09.613 --> 00:01:13.120
Do all parrots look the same?

13
00:01:13.121 --> 00:01:19.242
No. There are many different kinds of parrots.

14
00:01:19.243 --> 00:01:24.114
But we all have curved beaks.

15
00:01:24.115 --> 00:01:30.440
And we all have four toes!

16
00:01:30.441 --> 00:01:34.180
Can parrots really learn words?

17
00:01:34.181 --> 00:01:39.926
Yep. Parrots are very smart birds.

18
00:01:39.927 --> 00:01:44.974
Some parrots can learn words from people.

19
00:01:44.975 --> 00:01:50.153
We can imitate other sounds too.

20
00:01:50.154 --> 00:01:53.249
Do you live alone?

21
00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:58.100
Parrots live in groups called flocks.

22
00:01:58.101 --> 00:02:02.394
We like to talk to each other.

23
00:02:02.395 --> 00:02:06.870
We scream and squawk!

24
00:02:06.871 --> 00:02:11.120
Do you have any enemies?

25
00:02:11.121 --> 00:02:15.611
People are our main enemy.

26
00:02:15.612 --> 00:02:23.794
They often take us for pets.

27
00:02:23.795 --> 00:02:30.945
I see my flock. Good-bye!

28
00:02:30.946 --> 00:02:37.852
Good-bye, Parrot!
